Joern Lubkoll from dobag Berlin writes:

>i'm playing a level 18 babarian and i'm trying to write some nice scrolls
>of genocide. But when a)pplying my magic marker and entering the letter of
>the blank scroll to write on and the name of the scroll to write, nethack
>will always respond with 'your marker is to dry to write with'.
>
>why ? What can i do against that ?


You'll need to recharge that marker, with a scroll of charging.  With
a single (uncursed) scroll, you'll get on the order of dozens of
additional charges to the marker.  Identify the marker to see exactly
how many charges you have.

